==Rules==
{{StageRule|Summer}}

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Gavel Base (Enemy Base)|Gavel Base]].
*10 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Project A]] spawns.
**5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Bore]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even though this stage is a 8 star, it is quite easy, with the right units you wont even need the Cats Of The Cosmos treasures. Long range units and i-cat are a must without ubers. Bring tough units with a long recharge as money can easily be drained in this stage. Ubers like phono can help you a lot due to the diverse nature of the stage. Good luck.

